================================================================================
Intelligence → Patterns: certified patterns, certification gauge, green/red chart
================================================================================

Context:
Patterns can now be certified by the user. No pattern is certified by default.
The pattern details toolbar gets a Certify toggle and, next to "Matching
entities", a gauge showing the share of entities that follow a certified
pattern. In "Matching entities per pattern", certified patterns are green and
non-certified ones are red. Certification is stored per saved Detect run (the
view every Detect opens), so the live, unsaved view shows no certification UI.

Changes:
1. src/back/core/graph_analysis/pattern/SavedPatternStore.py
   - New nullable `certified BOOLEAN` column on the saved catalog table
     (created for new tables, added by the existing column migration for old
     ones). Save never writes it, so every pattern starts non-certified.
   - `patterns()` returns `certified` per pattern and
     `stats.certified_pattern_count` / `stats.certified_count` (entities in
     certified patterns).
   - New `set_certified(saved_id, pattern_id, certified)`; rejects an unknown
     pattern or a missing pattern_id.
2. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/TwinAnalytics.py
   - `certify_saved_pattern` delegator.
3. src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py
   - New `PUT /dtwin/patterns/saved/{saved_id}/certification`
     (`{pattern_id, certified}`, builder role at domain scope).
4. src/front/static/intelligence/js/intelligence-patterns.js
   - Certify / Certified toggle in the toolbar, certified icon in the picker,
     certification gauge (donut + %) after the "Matching entities" button,
     green / red bars with a legend in the chart. The toolbar and chart are
     re-rendered in place after a toggle, so the diagram is not reloaded.
   - Gauge: certified entities / run population (falls back to covered entities
     for runs saved without a population). Everything else counts as not
     certified.
5. src/front/static/intelligence/css/intelligence.css,
   src/front/static/global/css/permissions.css
   - Status-colour bars, legend, gauge and toggle styles; the toggle is blocked
     for viewers and read-only versions like the other pattern write actions.
6. src/front/templates/partials/intelligence/_intel_patterns_saved.html,
   src/front/templates/partials/layout/help_modal.html, docs/architecture.md
   - Documented the certification feature and endpoint.
7. tests/units/core/test_saved_pattern_store.py,
   tests/units/front/test_intelligence_page_contract.py
   - Default non-certified, certify / un-certify, per-run scope, validation,
     migration of old tables, and the UI contract.

