================================================================================
Intelligence → Patterns: group the chart by certification
================================================================================

Context:
Follow-up to the certified patterns work. The "Matching entities per pattern"
chart gets a "Group by certification" switch that merges all certified and all
non-certified patterns into two bars. The detail canvas then lists every
pattern of the selected group with its values, and "Matching entities" opens
the entities of the whole group.

Changes:
1. src/front/static/intelligence/js/intelligence-patterns.js
   - Chart switch (saved runs only). Grouped mode draws a green Certified bar and
     a red Not certified bar (entities, % of the population, pattern count).
     Clicking a bar selects the group.
   - Group detail canvas: group toolbar (Patterns / Entities / Share KPIs,
     Matching entities, gauge) and a table of the group's patterns (entities,
     share, meter; top 100). Clicking a row opens that pattern and leaves
     grouped mode.
   - Matching entities in grouped mode pages the members of the whole group.
2. src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py,
   src/back/objects/digitaltwin/TwinAnalytics.py,
   src/back/core/graph_analysis/pattern/SavedPatternStore.py
   - `GET /dtwin/patterns/saved/{id}/members` accepts `certified=true|false`
     (used when no pattern_id is given), for both live-Detect and legacy
     member-row snapshots.
3. src/back/core/graph_analysis/pattern/SavedKpiBackfill.py (new),
   src/back/core/graph_analysis/pattern/saved_pattern_sql.py
   - The KPI backfill methods moved out of SavedPatternStore into a mixin to
     stay under the 800-LOC class budget; `as_int` now lives in
     saved_pattern_sql.py. No behaviour change.
4. src/front/static/intelligence/css/intelligence.css
   - Switch, group table, meter and status-colour styles.
5. src/front/templates/partials/intelligence/_intel_patterns_saved.html,
   src/front/templates/partials/layout/help_modal.html, docs/architecture.md
   - Documentation of the switch and the `certified` members filter.
6. tests/units/core/test_saved_pattern_store.py,
   tests/units/front/test_intelligence_page_contract.py
   - Members filtered by certification (catalog and legacy rows); UI contract.

